1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:04,986
Yesterday, pigeons. Today, obedience.

2
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:07,217
The pigeons are still here.

3
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:13,495
The Obedience Megaphone.
One word, and everyone
does exactly what I say.

4
00:00:13,535 --> 00:00:16,416
Three, two, one!

5
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:20,670
People of Earth! Kneel before me!

6
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,169
Oh, terribly sorry. After you.

7
00:00:24,209 --> 00:00:27,573
No, no, I insist. After you.

8
00:00:27,613 --> 00:00:29,449
I said kneel!

9
00:00:29,919 --> 00:00:33,860
Of course! Can I get you anything?
A cup of tea?

10
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,806
He's very obedient.

11
00:00:35,846 --> 00:00:37,802
Stop being nice to me!

12
00:00:37,842 --> 00:00:40,723
You're doing a wonderful job, love.

13
00:00:42,093 --> 00:00:46,106
About the rent, dear.
No rush at all.

14
00:00:46,146 --> 00:00:48,087
Leave it on.
